From 581a6027682f313c957e04d3c003e5c56a991189 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: quigon <quigon@localhost>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 15:40:49 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] media: mediatek: vcodec: MT8189 H.264 encoder (common
 firmware interface), quigon DT

From ChromeOS chromeos-6.6: the encoder backend for the common firmware interface (venc/venc_common_if.c: a shared
VSI in SCP memory holds the configuration, working buffers and frame/bitstream addresses), its init message pair
(_comm: codec type in, VSI address out), routing H.264 to it, frm_buf.num_planes, and MT8189 platform data (34-bit
DMA, larb7 in IOMMU region 1). SCP only (ChromeOS also has a VCP path), no MMDVFS. DT: VEN0 domain with the larb7
gate as subsys clock, venc clock controller, SMI larb7, the encoder node.
---
